{"repositoryId":723372442,"availability":"available","full":"CiroMirkin/Capo","name":"Capo","description":"Organizar tareas personal sin distracciones.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":21,"forks":0,"created":"2023-11-25T13:12:28Z","updated":"2026-10-03T13:35:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"www.capoboard.app","topics":["better-auth","i18next","nextjs","playwright","prisma","tailwind-css","typescript"],"demo":"https://cappo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.648Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.648Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.648Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.648Z","stars":21,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Un tablero personal para organizar tu semana de trabajo sin distracciones.","Capo reúne en una sola interfaz tres cosas que normalmente viven en apps separadas: el tablero de tareas, la nota de contexto de cada tablero y la auditoría de tiempo (registro de uso + archivo histórico). Está pensado para una sola persona —no para equipos— que gestiona su propio trabajo en entornos de alta carga mental.","Capo funciona con o sin cuenta, y sin cuenta funciona entero. Sin sesión, toda la persistencia cae en el localStorage del navegador y no se pierde ninguna funcionalidad central. Con sesión, los datos persisten en PostgreSQL y se habilitan hasta 5 tableros independientes."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CiroMirkin/Capo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2405c77173e1d3ea30a49e8a23b1f181d083038b8a6a4146d84e42ea1d34f9a8","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.816Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.816Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Un tablero personal para organizar tu semana de trabajo sin distracciones.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CiroMirkin/Capo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"2405c77173e1d3ea30a49e8a23b1f181d0